  "rewardData": "Magic Seedball Recipe__$5.00(https://cdn.images.indiegogo.com/productimage/noimage.jpg) | Transition Streets Handbook__$10.00(https://cdn.images.indiegogo.com/productimage/noimage.jpg) | Save the Monarchs!__$50.00(https://cdn.images.indiegogo.com/productimage/noimage.jpg) | Feel Amazing__$250.00(https://cdn.images.indiegogo.com/productimage/noimage.jpg) | Sonoma Co Transition Tour__$500.00(https://cdn.images.indiegogo.com/productimage/noimage.jpg) | Cobb Mountain 2-night Getaway__$500.00(https://cdn.images.indiegogo.com/productimage/noimage.jpg) | Permaculture Design Course__$1,275.00(https://cdn.images.indiegogo.com/productimage/noimage.jpg) | ",
